cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this benchmark, please cite it as below and record the exact
  release identifier and component versions used for your experiment.
title: SmallOWBench 2.0
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Cao
    given-names: Junjun
repository-code: https://github.com/caojiajun777/small-ow-agent-bench
url: https://huggingface.co/datasets/junjun77/small-ow-agent-bench
license: Apache-2.0
version: 2.0.0-rc.2
abstract: >-
  An execution-based diagnostic benchmark for compact open-weight coding
  agents, with 62 authored small Python engineering workflows across five
  skills. Task and grader components are version 2.0.0-rc.2; the lightweight
  shell harness remains version 2.0.0-rc.1. Artifact measures verified
  deliverables; Clean additionally requires a normal protocol finish and is
  not a real-world software-development E2E success rate. Existing RC2
  container evidence covers five selected tasks with ten oracle/no-op slots,
  not full-bank acceptance. New formal model scores await this release's run;
  published legacy results do not transfer to the redesigned task bank.
keywords:
  - agents
  - code
  - benchmark
  - open-weight
  - compact-shell
